# NASA Space Dashboard has NO server-side environment variables and no build step.
#
# How the API key works in this project:
#   - The visitor enters their own free NASA API key (from https://api.nasa.gov)
#     in the settings field at the top of the page.
#   - The key is stored ONLY in that visitor's browser localStorage and is sent
#     only to api.nasa.gov as the `api_key` query parameter.
#   - With no key saved, the app falls back to NASA's shared DEMO_KEY
#     (30 requests/hour, 50/day per IP) and says so in the UI.
#
# NEVER put a real key in this file or anywhere else in the repo.
